    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/12/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "かわいらしく　個性的な　盾。持たせると　相手に特性を　変えられない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "귀엽고 개성적인 방패. 지니게 하면 상대에 의해 특성이 바뀌지 않는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "既可愛又有個性的盾。攜帶後，不會被對手變更特性。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Un bouclier à l’aspect unique et mignon. Il empêche l’adversaire de changer le talent du porteur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein niedlicher Schild mit eigenwilligem Design. Gibt man ihn einem Pokémon zum Tragen, kann dessen Fähigkeit nicht von anderen Pokémon geändert werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un escudo muy bonito de aspecto singular. Impide que otros Pokémon cambien la habilidad del Pokémon que lo lleva.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon. Adorabile e peculiare scudo che impedisce agli altri Pokémon di modificare l’abilità di chi lo ha con sé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This cute and rather unique-looking shield protects the holder from having its Ability changed by others.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かわいらしく　個性的な　盾。持たせると　相手に特性を　変えられない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可爱而有个性的盾。携带后，特性不会被对手改变。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
